{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_111233_p69_b17", "persona_id": "db:69", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "1. 面对技术型客户，先确认并解决其核心异议（如GMS兼容性），再转向需求挖掘，避免陷入纯参数辩论。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_111929"}
